(4, 'Rakib', '01745536278', 'Barguna', 'Test Succeed again', '2025-01-26 11:37:13', 'Social and Cultural Events'),
(5, 'Rafi', '016756849832', 'Banani', 'I want to organize a community clean-up event in our locality. The streets and parks have become littered with garbage, and it’s high time we all come together to clean it up. We can involve volunteers, distribute cleaning supplies, and make this a fun and impactful day for everyone.', '2025-01-26 14:33:54', 'Community Development Events'),
(6, 'Shifa', '016756849832', 'Mirpur', 'Our area lacks greenery, and I believe planting trees could make a big difference. I’m planning a tree plantation event where we’ll gather at the local park or empty spaces and plant trees together. It’s not just about beautifying the area but also about contributing to the environment', '2025-01-26 14:39:12', 'Environment and Sustainability'),
(7, 'Shifa', '016756849832', 'Mirpur', 'Many people in our area don’t follow traffic rules, and accidents are becoming frequent. I want to hold a road safety awareness program where we can educate people about safe driving, using footpaths, and pedestrian crossings. We can even distribute leaflets and banners to spread the message', '2025-01-26 14:42:22', 'Community Development Events'),
(8, 'Shifa', '016756849832', 'Mirpur', 'I want to organize a community funding event to address some critical issues in our area. The idea is to bring together local residents, businesses, and authorities to contribute funds toward a specific cause—like building a community park, repairing roads, or installing streetlights. We could make the event engaging by including cultural performances, raffles, or small donation challenges to encourage participation. Every little contribution will help make our locality a better place for everyone.', '2025-01-26 14:43:25', 'Social and Cultural Events'),
(9, 'Shifa', '016756849832', 'Mirpur', 'Today, [Person’s Name], a beloved member of our community, was involved in a terrible accident and is in critical need of immediate medical care. The treatment costs are beyond what their family can afford, and time is of the essence. I’m organizing an emergency fund to help cover the medical expenses, including surgery, ICU care, and recovery costs. Every contribution, no matter how small, can make a significant impact and could even save their life. Let’s come together as a community to support them in this time of crisis.', '2025-01-26 14:54:29', 'Social and Cultural Events'),
(10, 'Rahat', '01873203428', 'Mirpur', 'Good morning everyone! Today, we\'re gathering here in Mirpur for a community clean-up drive. Our goal is to improve the cleanliness of our local streets and reduce the waste that clutters our environment. Let\'s work together to make Mirpur a cleaner, greener place to live. Don\'t forget to bring your gloves and a positive attitude!', '2025-01-26 18:27:32', 'Community Development Events'),
(11, 'Zihadul ', '01476584648', 'Uttara', ' Tonight, we are raising funds to support scholarships for deserving students across Bangladesh. Your generous contributions will provide life-changing educational opportunities for those in need. Together, we can help shape a brighter future for our youth.', '2025-01-26 20:18:12', 'Social and Cultural Events'),
(13, 'Afia', '015644878', 'Uttara', 'Hello and welcome to our Sports Day Fundraiser in Dhaka! Today, we’re celebrating the strength and determination of disabled athletes. Your participation and donations will help fund adaptive sports equipment and training programs. Let\'s cheer on our athletes and show our support for their incredible achievements!', '2025-01-26 20:27:57', 'Social and Cultural Events'),
(14, 'Sohan', '01562034289', 'Uttara', 'Partner with a hospital or blood bank to host a blood donation camp. Invite residents to donate blood and provide refreshments and certificates for donors.', '2025-01-27 05:05:55', 'Health and Wellness Events'),
(15, 'Sohan', '01562034289', 'Uttara', 'Hold sessions on safe driving practices, proper use of zebra crossings, and traffic rules. Distribute helmets or reflectors to raise awareness about road safety.', '2025-01-27 05:06:39', 'Community Development Events'),
(17, 'Mim', '018732034289', 'Uttara', 'poseruhgfposerh', '2025-05-31 17:55:48', 'Environment and Sustainability'),
(18, 'Mim', '018732034289', 'Uttara', 'alsjdhfipuasdhfopa', '2025-05-31 17:55:56', 'Others'),
(19, 'Mim', '018732034289', 'Uttara', 'oiu[ipup[', '2025-05-31 17:57:21', 'Health and Wellness Events'),
(20, 'Mim', '018732034289', 'Uttara', 'uhpoi', '2025-05-31 17:57:28', 'Environment and Sustainability'),
(21, 'Mim', '018732034289', 'Uttara', 'jhbh', '2025-05-31 17:57:40', 'Health and Wellness Events');

